# Gix's Command, "Choose two": modes 2 and 3, resolved in printed order. Destroy each creature with power 2 or less takes
# Bot1's Ornithopter and Bot2's power-two Grizzly Bears together, and then "return up to two creature cards from
# your graveyard to your hand" gives Bot1 back its Ornithopter. Bot2's creatures stay in Bot2's graveyard.

